<title>FINLAND: M-Serla 1996 profit falls to FIM 315 mln.</title>
<headline>M-Serla 1996 profit falls to FIM 315 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		   315 vs 1,914</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.65 vs 8.74</p>
<p> Proposed dividend				 1.00 vs 7.00</p>
<p> Net sales					 14,671 vs 13,321</p>
<p> Operating profit				   902 vs 2,387</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish forest industry group had been for a 200 million markka profit.  </p>
<p> Depreciation				     1,128 vs 811</p>
<p> Change in exchange rates		charge 131 vs 12 gain</p>
<p> Other financial items		   charge 456 vs 485 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			 gain 385 vs 1 charge</p>
<p> Profit before minorities, taxes		700 vs 1,913</p>
<p> Minorities				    charge 4 vs 318 charge</p>
<p> Taxes						  224 vs 486</p>
<p> Net profit					   472 vs 1,109</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    37.2 vs 42.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Metsa-Serla Oy.</p>
